   "text": "Exact join links records by a real shared key. Entity resolution matches records without one\n(e.g. the same product ID string in two Amazon datasets) and records a confidence.",
   "originalText": "Exact join links records by a real shared key. Entity resolution matches records without one\n(e.g. the same product ID string in two Amazon datasets) and records a confidence.",
